# dex2oat is denied { search } on the DE data directory of priv-apps
# (com.google.android.gms) while dexopting and falls back to a profile-less compile.
# The denial cannot be granted: system/sepolicy/private/domain.te carries
#   neverallow base_typeattr_498 privapp_data_file (dir (ioctl read write create
#       getattr setattr lock ... open ...))
# so any dir permission, getattr included, trips the neverallow check. The file is
# kept (comment only) so the sepolicy directory glob stays unchanged and Soong does
# not re-run its full analysis for a deletion.
